OL,3,ALearner drivers still forced to wait
OL,4,Amonths to book tests
OL,5,
OL,6,FLearner drivers have to wait an average
OL,7,F20 weeks, or around five months, before
OL,8,Fbooking a practical test, according to
OL,9,Fnew figures, despite attempts to reduce
OL,10,Fdelays.
OL,12,FThe data from the Driver and Vehicle
OL,13,FStandards Agency (DVSA) for August is
OL,14,Fonly a marginal improvement from 20.2
OL,15,Fweeks in July.
OL,17,FThe average wait time between booking
OL,18,Fand sitting a test is unchanged at 11.1
OL,19,Fweeks.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
