OL,3,ALearner drivers still forced to wait
OL,4,Amonths to book tests
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe DVSA initially had a target of
OL,7,Freducing the average waiting time to
OL,8,Fseven weeks by the end of last year.
OL,9,FTransport Secretary Heidi Alexander
OL,10,Fpushed the target back to summer 2026,
OL,11,Fbut subsequently admitted even that
OL,12,Fwould not be possible.
